#. type: Title =
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenEMS: Production, consumption, grid and storage"
msgstr "OpenEMS: Erzeugung, Verbrauch, Netz und Speicher"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:9
msgid ""
"__As of: 2026-11-01 · OpenEMS version 2026.11.0-SNAPSHOT (development "
"version, branch develop)__"
msgstr ""
"__Stand: 01.11.2026 · OpenEMS-Version 2026.11.0-SNAPSHOT (Entwicklungsstand, "
"Branch develop)__"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:11
msgid ""
"This page explains the basic terms that appear everywhere in the web "
"interface and in the history, and where the values come from: **What is "
"measured and what does OpenEMS calculate?** This is particularly helpful "
"when values seem implausible."
msgstr ""
"Diese Seite erklärt die Grundbegriffe, die in der Weboberfläche und in der "
"Historie überall vorkommen, und woher die Werte kommen: **Was wird gemessen, "
"was rechnet OpenEMS aus?** Das hilft vor allem dann, wenn Werte unplausibel "
"erscheinen."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "The basic terms"
msgstr "Die Grundbegriffe"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Term\n"
"| Meaning\n"
"\n"
"| **Production** (generation)\n"
"| Electricity supplied by your own producers, usually the PV system. Includes AC producers (PV inverters, production meters) and DC producers (PV modules directly on the hybrid inverter).\n"
"| **Grid purchase** (buy)\n"
"| Electricity flowing from the public grid into the house.\n"
"| **Grid feed-in** (sell)\n"
"| Electricity flowing from the house into the public grid.\n"
"| **Charging**\n"
"| Electricity flowing into the home storage (battery).\n"
"| **Discharging**\n"
"| Electricity coming from the home storage.\n"
"| **Consumption**\n"
"| Electricity needed by all consumers in the house together: household, heat pump, wallbox, etc.\n"
"| **State of charge** (SoC)\n"
"| Charge level of the home storage in percent.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Begriff\n"
"| Bedeutung\n"
"\n"
"| **Erzeugung**\n"
"| Strom, den die eigenen Erzeuger liefern, meist die PV-Anlage. Umfasst AC-Erzeuger (PV-Wechselrichter, Erzeugungszähler) und DC-Erzeuger (PV-Module direkt am Hybrid-Wechselrichter).\n"
"| **Netzbezug** (Bezug, Kauf)\n"
"| Strom, der aus dem öffentlichen Netz ins Haus fließt.\n"
"| **Netzeinspeisung** (Einspeisung, Verkauf)\n"
"| Strom, der aus dem Haus ins öffentliche Netz fließt.\n"
"| **Beladung**\n"
"| Strom, der in den Hausspeicher (Batterie) fließt.\n"
"| **Entladung**\n"
"| Strom, der aus dem Hausspeicher kommt.\n"
"| **Verbrauch**\n"
"| Strom, den alle Verbraucher im Haus zusammen benötigen: Haushalt, Wärmepumpe, Wallbox usw.\n"
"| **Ladezustand** (SoC)\n"
"| Füllstand des Hausspeichers in Prozent.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Power and energy"
msgstr "Leistung und Energie"

#. type: #sec-power-and-energy
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:40
msgid ""
"**Power** (watts, W / kW) is the instantaneous value: “3 kW are flowing "
"right now”."
msgstr ""
"**Leistung** (Watt, W / kW) ist der Augenblickswert: „gerade jetzt fließen 3 "
"kW“."

#. type: #sec-power-and-energy
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:41
msgid ""
"**Energy** (watt hours, Wh / kWh) is the amount over a period of time: “12 "
"kWh were purchased today”."
msgstr ""
"**Energie** (Wattstunden, Wh / kWh) ist die Menge über eine Zeit: „heute "
"wurden 12 kWh bezogen“."

#. type: #sec-power-and-energy
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:43
msgid ""
"OpenEMS stores energy as a running **meter reading**, like the electricity "
"meter in the basement. The energy of a day is the difference between the "
"meter readings (see xref:user/data/history-rrd4j.adoc[History])."
msgstr ""
"OpenEMS speichert Energie als fortlaufenden **Zählerstand**, wie der "
"Stromzähler im Keller. Die Energie eines Tages ist der Unterschied der "
"Zählerstände (siehe xref:user/data/history-rrd4j.adoc[Historie])."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Signs"
msgstr "Vorzeichen"

#. type: #sec-signs
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:48
msgid "Some values have a sign that indicates the direction:"
msgstr "Einige Werte haben ein Vorzeichen, das die Richtung angibt:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Value\n"
"| positive ({plus})\n"
"| negative (−)\n"
"\n"
"| Grid power\n"
"| Purchase from the grid\n"
"| Feed-in to the grid\n"
"| Storage power\n"
"| Discharging\n"
"| Charging\n"
"| Production, consumption\n"
"| always positive\n"
"| –\n"
msgstr ""
"| Wert\n"
"| positiv ({plus})\n"
"| negativ (−)\n"
"\n"
"| Netzleistung\n"
"| Bezug aus dem Netz\n"
"| Einspeisung ins Netz\n"
"| Speicherleistung\n"
"| Entladung\n"
"| Beladung\n"
"| Erzeugung, Verbrauch\n"
"| immer positiv\n"
"| –\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "The energy balance"
msgstr "Die Energiebilanz"

#. type: #sec-the-energy-balance
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:70
msgid ""
"Everything that comes into the house must also go somewhere. This results in:"
msgstr ""
"Alles, was ins Haus hineinkommt, muss auch irgendwo hin. Daraus ergibt sich:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Consumption = production + grid purchase − grid feed-in + discharging − charging\n"
msgstr "Verbrauch = Erzeugung + Netzbezug − Netzeinspeisung + Entladung − Beladung\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:77
msgid "or with signs:"
msgstr "oder mit Vorzeichen:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "Consumption = production + grid power + storage power\n"
msgstr "Verbrauch = Erzeugung + Netzleistung + Speicherleistung\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:84
msgid ""
"Example: PV delivers 5 kW, the storage charges with 2 kW (−2 kW), 1 kW goes "
"into the grid (−1 kW). Consumption = 5 − 1 − 2 = 2 kW."
msgstr ""
"Beispiel: PV liefert 5 kW, der Speicher lädt mit 2 kW (−2 kW), ins Netz "
"gehen 1 kW (−1 kW). Verbrauch = 5 − 1 − 2 = 2 kW."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "Where the values come from"
msgstr "Woher die Werte kommen"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is measured"
msgstr "Was gemessen wird"

#. type: #sec-what-is-measured
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:92
msgid "Measurements are only taken at a few points:"
msgstr "Gemessen wird nur an wenigen Stellen:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Measuring point\n"
"| delivers\n"
"\n"
"| **Grid meter** (at the house connection)\n"
"| Grid power per phase, meter readings for purchase and feed-in\n"
"| **Production meter** or PV inverter\n"
"| AC production per phase, production meter reading\n"
"| **Hybrid inverter** or DC charge controller\n"
"| DC production (PV directly on the storage system)\n"
"| **Storage system**\n"
"| Charging/discharging power, state of charge, capacity\n"
"| other meters (e.g. wallbox, heat pump)\n"
"| Power and energy of these individual consumers\n"
msgstr ""
"| Messstelle\n"
"| liefert\n"
"\n"
"| **Netzzähler** (am Hausanschluss)\n"
"| Netzleistung je Phase, Zählerstände für Bezug und Einspeisung\n"
"| **Erzeugungszähler** bzw. PV-Wechselrichter\n"
"| AC-Erzeugung je Phase, Zählerstand der Erzeugung\n"
"| **Hybrid-Wechselrichter** bzw. DC-Laderegler\n"
"| DC-Erzeugung (PV direkt am Speichersystem)\n"
"| **Speichersystem**\n"
"| Lade-/Entladeleistung, Ladezustand, Kapazität\n"
"| weitere Zähler (z. B. Wallbox, Wärmepumpe)\n"
"| Leistung und Energie dieser einzelnen Verbraucher\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:111
msgid ""
"**Important:** Whether a device measures its meter readings (energy) itself "
"or whether OpenEMS calculates them from the power depends on the device or "
"its connection. Many storage systems and some meters only supply power. "
"OpenEMS then counts up the energy itself. These self-counted values are "
"prone to jumps on restart (see xref:user/data/history-rrd4j.adoc[History])."
msgstr ""
"**Wichtig:** Ob ein Gerät seine Zählerstände (Energie) selbst misst oder ob "
"OpenEMS sie aus der Leistung errechnet, hängt vom Gerät bzw. dessen "
"Anbindung ab. Viele Speicher und manche Zähler liefern nur die Leistung. "
"Dann zählt OpenEMS die Energie selbst hoch. Diese selbst gezählten Werte "
"sind anfällig für Sprünge bei einem Neustart (siehe xref:user/data/history-"
"rrd4j.adoc[Historie])."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is never measured: consumption"
msgstr "Was nie gemessen wird: der Verbrauch"

#. type: #sec-what-is-never-measured-consumption
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:116
msgid ""
"**The total consumption of the house is not measured in OpenEMS, but always "
"calculated**, according to the energy balance above:"
msgstr ""
"**Der Gesamtverbrauch des Hauses wird in OpenEMS nicht gemessen, sondern "
"immer berechnet**, nach der Energiebilanz oben:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:120
#, no-wrap
msgid "Consumption = grid power + AC production + AC power of the storage system\n"
msgstr "Verbrauch = Netzleistung + AC-Erzeugung + AC-Leistung des Speichersystems\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:123
msgid ""
"Even an existing consumption meter is currently not used for this total."
msgstr ""
"Auch ein vorhandener Verbrauchszähler wird für diese Summe derzeit nicht "
"verwendet."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:125
msgid ""
"It follows that: **Any measurement error in grid, production or storage ends "
"up in consumption.** If, for example, a production meter is missing in the "
"configuration or the grid meter measures a phase incorrectly, the "
"consumption is wrong, in extreme cases even negative."
msgstr ""
"Daraus folgt: **Jeder Messfehler bei Netz, Erzeugung oder Speicher landet im "
"Verbrauch.** Fehlt z. B. ein Erzeugungszähler in der Konfiguration oder "
"misst der Netzzähler eine Phase falsch, ist der Verbrauch falsch, im "
"Extremfall sogar negativ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:127
#, no-wrap
msgid "The total values (_sum)"
msgstr "Die Summenwerte (_sum)"

#. type: #sec-the-total-values-sum
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:130
msgid ""
"OpenEMS combines the values of all devices in the component `+_sum+`. The "
"web interface displays these values and they are stored in the history. They "
"are recalculated every second."
msgstr ""
"OpenEMS fasst die Werte aller Geräte in der Komponente `+_sum+` zusammen. "
"Diese Werte zeigt die Weboberfläche an, und sie werden in der Historie "
"gespeichert. Jede Sekunde wird neu gerechnet."

#. type: #sec-the-total-values-sum
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:132
msgid "Explanation of the origin:"
msgstr "Erklärung der Herkunft:"

#. type: #sec-the-total-values-sum
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:134
msgid ""
"**Sum of the devices:** The values of all matching devices are added up. The "
"measurement therefore takes place in the device; OpenEMS only adds."
msgstr ""
"**Summe der Geräte:** Die Werte aller passenden Geräte werden addiert. "
"Gemessen wird also im Gerät; OpenEMS addiert nur."

#. type: #sec-the-total-values-sum
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:135
msgid ""
"**Calculated:** The value is only created in `+_sum+` from other values. No "
"device measures it."
msgstr ""
"**Berechnet:** Der Wert entsteht erst in `+_sum+` aus anderen Werten. Kein "
"Gerät misst ihn."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "Power values"
msgstr "Leistungen"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:178
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Channel\n"
"| Meaning\n"
"| Origin\n"
"\n"
"| `+GridActivePower+` (and L1–L3)\n"
"| Grid power ({plus} purchase / − feed-in)\n"
"| Sum of the grid meters\n"
"| `+ProductionAcActivePower+` (and L1–L3)\n"
"| AC production\n"
"| Sum of the production meters / PV inverters\n"
"| `+ProductionDcActualPower+`\n"
"| DC production\n"
"| Sum of the DC charge controllers\n"
"| `+ProductionActivePower+`\n"
"| Total production\n"
"| calculated: AC {plus} DC\n"
"| `+EssActivePower+`\n"
"| Storage power at the inverter (AC; {plus} discharging / − charging)\n"
"| Sum of the storage systems\n"
"| `+EssActivePowerL1+`–`+L3+`\n"
"| Storage power per phase\n"
"| Sum; for storage systems without phase values **calculated** (total power ÷ 3)\n"
"| `+EssDischargePower+`\n"
"| Battery power ({plus} discharging / − charging); for hybrid systems on the battery side (DC)\n"
"| Sum of the storage systems\n"
"| `+EssSoc+`\n"
"| State of charge\n"
"| calculated: with several storage systems weighted by capacity; if a capacity is unknown, simple average\n"
"| `+ConsumptionActivePower+` (and L1–L3)\n"
"| Consumption\n"
"| **calculated:** grid {plus} AC production {plus} AC storage power\n"
"| `+UnmanagedConsumptionActivePower+`\n"
"| Consumption without controlled consumers (e.g. wallboxes)\n"
"| **calculated:** consumption − metered controlled consumers\n"
"| `+GridGensetActivePower+`\n"
"| Power of an emergency generator\n"
"| Sum of the corresponding meters\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kanal\n"
"| Bedeutung\n"
"| Herkunft\n"
"\n"
"| `+GridActivePower+` (und L1–L3)\n"
"| Netzleistung ({plus} Bezug / − Einspeisung)\n"
"| Summe der Netzzähler\n"
"| `+ProductionAcActivePower+` (und L1–L3)\n"
"| AC-Erzeugung\n"
"| Summe der Erzeugungszähler / PV-Wechselrichter\n"
"| `+ProductionDcActualPower+`\n"
"| DC-Erzeugung\n"
"| Summe der DC-Laderegler\n"
"| `+ProductionActivePower+`\n"
"| Gesamterzeugung\n"
"| berechnet: AC {plus} DC\n"
"| `+EssActivePower+`\n"
"| Speicherleistung am Wechselrichter (AC; {plus} Entladung / − Beladung)\n"
"| Summe der Speichersysteme\n"
"| `+EssActivePowerL1+`–`+L3+`\n"
"| Speicherleistung je Phase\n"
"| Summe; bei Speichern ohne Phasenwerte **berechnet** (Gesamtleistung ÷ 3)\n"
"| `+EssDischargePower+`\n"
"| Batterieleistung ({plus} Entladung / − Beladung); bei Hybrid-Systemen auf der Batterieseite (DC)\n"
"| Summe der Speichersysteme\n"
"| `+EssSoc+`\n"
"| Ladezustand\n"
"| berechnet: bei mehreren Speichern nach Kapazität gewichtet; ist eine Kapazität unbekannt, einfacher Mittelwert\n"
"| `+ConsumptionActivePower+` (und L1–L3)\n"
"| Verbrauch\n"
"| **berechnet:** Netz {plus} AC-Erzeugung {plus} AC-Speicherleistung\n"
"| `+UnmanagedConsumptionActivePower+`\n"
"| Verbrauch ohne gesteuerte Verbraucher (z. B. Wallboxen)\n"
"| **berechnet:** Verbrauch − gemessene gesteuerte Verbraucher\n"
"| `+GridGensetActivePower+`\n"
"| Leistung eines Notstromaggregats\n"
"| Summe der entsprechenden Zähler\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:181
#, no-wrap
msgid "Energy flows (“where does the electricity go?”)"
msgstr "Energieflüsse („wohin geht der Strom?“)"

#. type: #sec-energy-flows-where-does-the-electricity-go
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:184
msgid ""
"For the energy flow chart, OpenEMS divides the power values: how much solar "
"power goes into the house, how much into the storage, how much into the "
"grid? **These values are completely calculated**, there is no measurement "
"for them."
msgstr ""
"Für die Energiefluss-Grafik teilt OpenEMS die Leistungen auf: Wie viel "
"Solarstrom geht ins Haus, wie viel in den Speicher, wie viel ins Netz? "
"**Diese Werte sind vollständig berechnet**, es gibt dafür keine Messung."

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:202
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Channel\n"
"| Meaning\n"
"\n"
"| `+ProductionToConsumptionPower+`\n"
"| Solar → house\n"
"| `+ProductionToEssPower+`\n"
"| Solar → storage\n"
"| `+ProductionToGridPower+`\n"
"| Solar → grid\n"
"| `+GridToConsumptionPower+`\n"
"| Grid → house\n"
"| `+EssToConsumptionPower+`\n"
"| Storage → house\n"
"| `+GridToEssPower+`\n"
"| Grid → storage ({plus}) or storage → grid (−)\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kanal\n"
"| Bedeutung\n"
"\n"
"| `+ProductionToConsumptionPower+`\n"
"| Solar → Haus\n"
"| `+ProductionToEssPower+`\n"
"| Solar → Speicher\n"
"| `+ProductionToGridPower+`\n"
"| Solar → Netz\n"
"| `+GridToConsumptionPower+`\n"
"| Netz → Haus\n"
"| `+EssToConsumptionPower+`\n"
"| Speicher → Haus\n"
"| `+GridToEssPower+`\n"
"| Netz → Speicher ({plus}) bzw. Speicher → Netz (−)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:205
msgid "The division follows fixed rules:"
msgstr "Die Aufteilung folgt festen Regeln:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:207
msgid "If the storage is discharging, it supplies the house first."
msgstr "Entlädt der Speicher, versorgt er zuerst das Haus."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:208
msgid "If the storage is charging, the charge comes from production first."
msgstr "Lädt der Speicher, kommt die Ladung zuerst aus der Erzeugung."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:209
msgid ""
"The remaining production supplies the house; whatever is left goes into the "
"grid."
msgstr ""
"Die übrige Erzeugung versorgt das Haus; was dann noch übrig ist, geht ins "
"Netz."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:210
msgid "The grid covers the rest of the consumption."
msgstr "Den Rest des Verbrauchs deckt das Netz."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:211
msgid "Any grid power still remaining is counted as grid ↔ storage."
msgstr ""
"Was dann noch an Netzleistung übrig bleibt, wird als Netz ↔ Speicher "
"gewertet."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:213
#, no-wrap
msgid "Energy values (meter readings)"
msgstr "Energien (Zählerstände)"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:248
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Channel\n"
"| Meaning\n"
"| Origin\n"
"\n"
"| `+GridBuyActiveEnergy+`\n"
"| Grid purchase\n"
"| Sum of the grid meters\n"
"| `+GridSellActiveEnergy+`\n"
"| Grid feed-in\n"
"| Sum of the grid meters\n"
"| `+ProductionAcActiveEnergy+`\n"
"| AC production\n"
"| Sum of the production meters\n"
"| `+ProductionDcActiveEnergy+`\n"
"| DC production\n"
"| Sum of the DC charge controllers\n"
"| `+ProductionActiveEnergy+`\n"
"| Total production\n"
"| calculated: AC {plus} DC\n"
"| `+EssActiveChargeEnergy+` / `+EssActiveDischargeEnergy+`\n"
"| Storage charging / discharging at the inverter (AC)\n"
"| Sum of the storage systems\n"
"| `+EssDcChargeEnergy+` / `+EssDcDischargeEnergy+`\n"
"| Charging / discharging on the battery side (for hybrid systems)\n"
"| Sum of the storage systems\n"
"| `+ConsumptionActiveEnergy+`\n"
"| Consumption\n"
"| **calculated:** (discharging {plus} purchase {plus} production) − (charging {plus} feed-in {plus} self-consumption of the producers)\n"
"| `+ProductionToConsumptionEnergy+`, `+ProductionToGridEnergy+`, `+ProductionToEssEnergy+`, `+GridToConsumptionEnergy+`, `+EssToConsumptionEnergy+`, `+GridToEssEnergy+`, `+EssToGridEnergy+`\n"
"| Energy flows\n"
"| **calculated:** counted up by OpenEMS from the calculated flow power values\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kanal\n"
"| Bedeutung\n"
"| Herkunft\n"
"\n"
"| `+GridBuyActiveEnergy+`\n"
"| Netzbezug\n"
"| Summe der Netzzähler\n"
"| `+GridSellActiveEnergy+`\n"
"| Netzeinspeisung\n"
"| Summe der Netzzähler\n"
"| `+ProductionAcActiveEnergy+`\n"
"| AC-Erzeugung\n"
"| Summe der Erzeugungszähler\n"
"| `+ProductionDcActiveEnergy+`\n"
"| DC-Erzeugung\n"
"| Summe der DC-Laderegler\n"
"| `+ProductionActiveEnergy+`\n"
"| Gesamterzeugung\n"
"| berechnet: AC {plus} DC\n"
"| `+EssActiveChargeEnergy+` / `+EssActiveDischargeEnergy+`\n"
"| Speicher-Beladung / -Entladung am Wechselrichter (AC)\n"
"| Summe der Speichersysteme\n"
"| `+EssDcChargeEnergy+` / `+EssDcDischargeEnergy+`\n"
"| Beladung / Entladung auf der Batterieseite (bei Hybrid-Systemen)\n"
"| Summe der Speichersysteme\n"
"| `+ConsumptionActiveEnergy+`\n"
"| Verbrauch\n"
"| **berechnet:** (Entladung {plus} Bezug {plus} Erzeugung) − (Beladung {plus} Einspeisung {plus} Eigenverbrauch der Erzeuger)\n"
"| `+ProductionToConsumptionEnergy+`, `+ProductionToGridEnergy+`, `+ProductionToEssEnergy+`, `+GridToConsumptionEnergy+`, `+EssToConsumptionEnergy+`, `+GridToEssEnergy+`, `+EssToGridEnergy+`\n"
"| Energieflüsse\n"
"| **berechnet:** von OpenEMS aus den berechneten Flussleistungen hochgezählt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:251
msgid ""
"Note: For grid meters, the purchase is internally called “ProductionEnergy” "
"in OpenEMS and the feed-in “ConsumptionEnergy”, from the meter's point of "
"view. In `+_sum+` the names are unambiguous (Buy/Sell)."
msgstr ""
"Hinweis: Bei Netzzählern heißt der Bezug in OpenEMS intern "
"„ProductionEnergy“ und die Einspeisung „ConsumptionEnergy“, aus Sicht des "
"Zählers. In `+_sum+` sind die Namen eindeutig (Buy/Sell)."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:253
#, no-wrap
msgid "Other values"
msgstr "Sonstige Werte"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/basics/energy-flows.adoc:273
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Channel\n"
"| Meaning\n"
"| Origin\n"
"\n"
"| `+GridMode+`\n"
"| Grid mode or island mode (emergency power)\n"
"| from the storage system\n"
"| `+GridBuyPrice+` / `+GridSellPrice+`\n"
"| Current purchase / feed-in price\n"
"| from the xref:user/storage-control/time-of-use-tariffs.adoc[tariff]\n"
"| `+EssCapacity+`\n"
"| Capacity of all storage systems\n"
"| Sum of the storage systems\n"
"| `+State+`\n"
"| Most severe current fault state of all components\n"
"| calculated\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kanal\n"
"| Bedeutung\n"
"| Herkunft\n"
"\n"
"| `+GridMode+`\n"
"| Netzbetrieb oder Inselbetrieb (Notstrom)\n"
"| vom Speichersystem\n"
"| `+GridBuyPrice+` / `+GridSellPrice+`\n"
"| aktueller Bezugs- / Einspeisepreis\n"
"| aus dem xref:user/storage-control/time-of-use-tariffs.adoc[Tarif]\n"
